WEBVTT

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.440
We're still in the dog days of summer,

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.580
so how does a nice refreshing 
fireworks show sound?

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.820
A fireworks show?

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.750
Yes, it's part of the festival.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:48.130
We want each team to create
their own unique fireworks...

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:51.990
...by incorporating chakra and fire-style
jutsu with firework making techniques.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:01.250
We're doing it as a contest
to see which team...

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.180
...can design the most spectacular display.

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:09.000
Lee, your inability to use ninjutsu will
put you at a huge disadvantage.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.230
But this is just another 
trial to overcome.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.770
You must win, no matter what!

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:13.910
Yes, sir!

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:24.550
<b>Boom! The Shinobi Fireworks Show!</b>

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.050
<b>Leaf Village Fireworks Show
Sponsored by the Hokage</b>

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.670
Everyone's really pushing themselves...

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.750
It's gonna be tough to beat all of them.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.960
What's the best way to win?

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:41.030
We need a firework that'll 
leave everyone speechless,

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:42.890
or we have no chance of winning.

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.910
Leave them speechless...

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.390
What about this?

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.300
A sparkler?

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:53.950
Striking a pose and 
letting the sparks fly

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.010
would definitely do the trick, I think.

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:59.070
It'll leave them speechless, 
but out of boredom.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.570
All right.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.860
What if I strap a bunch 
of fireworks to my body,

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.540
and become a living spinner?

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.200
That'll shock 'em!

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.750
The only one who'll get shocked 
is you, I guarantee it.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.250
Fine.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.400
I'll become a human rocket and 
launch myself into the sky.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.210
That'll blow everyone away!

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.500
You'll blow everyone up, 
and yourself with them!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.180
Boom!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.740
This is really tough.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:30.610
Lee!

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.820
Sakura, you look beautiful 
in your yukata!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.440
Why thank you!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:43.240
S-Sakura, what kind 
of fireworks do you like?

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.200
Um, Lee...

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.700
The kind that really knocks 
your socks off, right?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.540
What are we wearing?!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.120
Or the really extravagant ones?

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:52.840
Why am I doing this, too?!

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.130
Oops, I lit it.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.960
Idiot! Put it out!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:57.960
With what?

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:00.890
Kakashi Sensei!

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:04.640
It's okay to have fun, 
but fire is not a toy.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:11.140
<b>Fire Safety</b>

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:10.250
You folks out there in TV land be
careful around fireworks, too!

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.940
Are you entering the 
contest, too, Sensei?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.590
No way. I'm just here in case 
of any fire emergencies.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.480
Just shout if you need me.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.450
I want to make a firework that'll
really amaze the audience,

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:24.960
but can't seem to get it right.

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.680
Fancy fireworks are fun, too,

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:29.160
but I think I like the simpler ones best.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:32.290
Well, let's all do our best!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.470
Simple, huh?

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.250
Okay.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:41.390
We'll go with a simple "human 
firework in deep space!"

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:43.090
How is that simple?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.510
Hey, what's going on here?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:53.660
And here we go!

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:57.350
It's time for the 
Leaf Village Fireworks Show!

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.310
Leading off is Team Seven!

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.690
Send 'em up!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.370
He threw it!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:07.660
Whoa!

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:12.120
Team Seven uses a wind-style jutsu
to make a giant windmill firework.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:15.030
Color commentator Lady 
Tsunade, what's your take?

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:17.140
It looks like a giant roulette wheel.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:18.540
You heard her, folks.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:21.050
Man, that's awesome.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.550
Great job, Naruto!

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.510
I could do that.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.590
Leaf Whirlwind!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.350
You don't need to spin, too!

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.220
S-Sakura's—

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:40.690
Uh oh, Naruto gets blasted 
by his own arsenal!

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.790
What did you think of the windmill?

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.180
It looked like the chrysanthemum 
card in hanafuda.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.400
You heard her, folks.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.450
They only got halfway through their set,

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.160
but it's going to be hard to 
outdo Naruto's fireworks.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.240
I know.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.210
Neji...

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.210
Forget it!

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.170
Next up, Team Eight!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.700
Backed by the Hyuga clan's wealth,

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.010
Team Eight has constructed a large 
array of extravagant fireworks!

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.500
What say you, Lady Tsunade?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.220
Reminds me of when someone else
hits the jackpot on a slot machine.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.430
You heard her, folks.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:22.770
This is awesome, Hinata!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:26.280
<i>N-Naruto's watching, g-gotta do my best!</i>

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.320
We can't beat such expensive fireworks!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.610
What now, Lee?

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:31.970
I'm on it.

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:34.810
I'll throw in an extra shot for free!

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.020
This isn't the shopping network!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.240
What would we do with more of these?!

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.120
Are you two still at it?

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:46.300
Lady Hinata!

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:52.270
N-N-N-N...

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.780
Not again!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.150
Lady Hinata!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.510
Oh my!

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:07.050
It looks like Hinata's heart lit off
the rest of the fireworks early!

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.870
What's your take, Lady Tsunade?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.110
You've gotta have that 
fire in your heart...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.870
...before you get into a do-or-die gamble!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:15.120
You heard her, folks...

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.970
We'll need something even 
fancier to beat them,

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.550
but we don't have that kind of money.

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:24.150
It's cool, Tenten.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.770
We've still got time.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.840
Let's do a fund raiser.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.260
Are you selling yakisoba?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:33.300
We've got more than that.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.260
Okonomiyaki, takoyaki, 
chocolate bananas!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.180
Too much variety!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.680
This is supposed to be serious contest,

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.590
no one's gonna stop to eat!

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.150
Although you do have a customer.

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:49.070
Stop eating!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.300
Time for Team Ten's turn!

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.990
How troublesome.

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.450
Ooh!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:02.840
Shikamaru's Shadow Pull gives us a
masterful display of timed fireworks!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.380
What do you think, Lady Tsunade?

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.380
It's a like a masterful 
display of cheating.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:11.550
Can we please get away from 
the gambling analogies?!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.800
Shikamaru's group is cool, too!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:16.300
That does it...

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:18.900
I'll go myself!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.730
Time for the finale, Choji!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.950
What're you eating?!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:25.310
Takoyaki.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:29.690
Do you have to do that right now?!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.270
I'm hungry.

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:34.740
Uh oh!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.300
Choji has accidentally 
eaten a firework!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.250
Don't come over here!

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.090
What next?

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.900
I've been waiting for this chance!

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:50.930
That's...

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.130
Orochimaru!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:57.230
I'll use the confusion to 
light my giant black snake!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.240
Shoot, I can't move 
well in this outfit...

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:03.890
Naruto!

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:06.350
He's down for the count!

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.310
Then Guy Sensei...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.530
The heat from the takoyaki KO-ed him!

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:15.170
Looks like it's up to me.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:18.450
Ah, yes. The airhead setup man.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.320
A-Airhead...

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.980
I'm not an airhead!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.620
Where are you going?!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.860
Fine, I'll handle you!

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:30.710
Oh...

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.130
The president of punchlines?

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:36.540
Punchlines...

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.220
It's not like I enjoy it!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.650
I don't know what I'm doing with my life!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:43.810
Not you, too!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:47.560
Neji and Tenten are finished...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.770
Prepare yourselves.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.550
That's right!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.280
I need to wake Kakashi Sensei!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:57.570
Sakura.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.500
You're lit!

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.910
Kakashi Sensei!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:08.990
What?!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:13.030
Kakashi Sensei, we need 
a water jutsu please...

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:14.340
O-Okay...

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:25.850
The fireworks show was stopped 
due to Orochimaru's disruption.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:31.260
It's too bad they had 
to cancel the show.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.020
Yes.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:38.230
Well, I had to use my best 
firework to wake Kakashi Sensei.

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.440
I wish I could've seen 
what you came up with.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.630
Actually, I have some left.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.860
They're just boring old sparklers,

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:47.270
but how about lighting them with me?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:58.260
Yeah, when all's said and done, 
I like the simple ones best.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:10:59.960
Sakura...

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.310
Why?!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:10.560
<i>I'll throw in an extra shot for free!</i>

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.630
An extra shot...

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:20.500
And so Lee's feelings, and Lee himself,
were scattered across the heavens.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.130
Sakura!

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:23.860
Lee!

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:26.880
Enjoy fireworks safely, everyone!

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.890
The season of love.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:41.010
Maybe it's this season, 
when the sun shines so bright...

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.900
You're impressive as always.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:47.150
I'll have to use my special move
that only works in the summer!

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.640
Huh? A move that utilizes the summer?

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:58.330
My summertime special 
move, the "Summer Wrap!"

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:00.320
Summer wraps are dresses!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:03.070
That one was too hard for 
the kids in the audience!

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:07.570
Say something, Tenten!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.760
<b>Bang! Tenten's Acting Weird!</b>

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:34.560
Something's wrong.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.540
Tenten's not her usual 
energetic self lately.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.520
You think something happened?

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:44.530
I'm worried, too. We really 
need to snap her out of this.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:47.490
We'll lose our main straight man.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.510
Straight man...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:50.700
That's it!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.480
I know a way to get 
Tenten back to normal!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.420
Boy, it's hot.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.800
On days like this...

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.560
...you really crave something too cold.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.260
Leave it to me!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.220
<b>Family 
Restaurant</b>

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.220
<b>Leaf</b>

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.750
<i>It's been five years since 
we started dating...</i>

00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:20.580
<i>We used to go to all kinds 
of places, but lately...</i>

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.820
<i>It's just whatever restaurant 
we're closest to.</i>

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.160
Pass the sauce.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.580
Um...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:38.740
Maybe... we should break up...

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.630
If that's what you want, then sure.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:47.330
No way...

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:48.650
Jeez.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:52.730
There's a surprising 
amount of relationships...

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:54.810
...that have gone cold in the world.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.530
<i>Nice, Lee!</i>

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:59.140
<i>Tenten's the number one 
straight man on our show.</i>

00:13:59.140 --> 00:13:59.900
<i>Any second, she'll...</i>

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.720
<i>That's the wrong kind of cold!</i>

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.260
<i>And Tenten will be back to normal!</i>

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.320
<i>Come on, Tenten! Let us have it!</i>

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.000
Something's definitely wrong!

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.800
We've really gotta do something!

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.640
Yeah, but what?

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.460
This is serious. It's gonna 
be hard to ask what's wrong.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:28.430
Still, let's give it a shot.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.890
Rock Lee Papa
Neji Mama
Tenko

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:30.890
Yum!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.060
Mother, you cook the 
best veggies in Japan!

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:36.690
Oh, you...

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.310
S-So, how's school going?

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.030
Making lots of friends?

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:51.490
If there's anything on your mind,
you can always talk to your father.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.660
Daddy may not look like much,

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:56.100
but everyone at work comes 
to me with their troubles!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:59.040
I-Isn't that nice, Tenko?

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.420
Tenko, wait!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:06.980
Your father...

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.280
We're doomed.

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:13.390
We're just digging ourselves deeper!

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:18.850
Bushy-Brows, Neji, what's wrong?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.100
Naruto!

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.270
Tenten's feeling down, huh?

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.640
How long has she been acting this way?

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:28.830
I'd say...

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.490
Since the fireworks show, I think.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:33.470
Hmm...

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.170
Ah ha!

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.610
I bet she wanted to 
light more fireworks!

00:15:37.610 --> 00:15:39.610
Fireworks?

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:41.380
Now that you mention it,

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:44.380
it's always a little sad 
when the show's over.

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.260
We know the problem, now let's fix it!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.590
Tenten!

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:58.200
Since the fireworks show got 
shut down halfway through,

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.210
I thought we could light 
some off tonight.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:01.460
You'll join us, right?

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.060
We bought all different kinds.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.720
Sparklers, spinners...

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:08.610
Everything from the big 
blasts to black snakes!

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.180
And of course, rockets!

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:15.910
When did you－

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:23.320
Why me, too?!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.530
So it wasn't the fireworks?

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:30.380
Nope.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:34.240
Maybe we're forgetting 
something important.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.680
Whatcha doing?

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:43.350
Choji, did we forget anything important
on the day of the fireworks show?

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.150
Important...

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.240
You forgot to eat a 
chocolate-covered banana!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:50.350
Or something.

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:51.820
Chocolate-covered banana...

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:56.410
That must be it. 
Tenten must not have eaten one!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:17:00.790
Yes! Women love treats, 
especially sweet things!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.250
Let's hurry!

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:09.050
We prepared a chocolate 
fountain for you, Tenten!

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:12.670
We've got plenty to dip! 
Fruit, sponge cake...

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.640
And rice and spaghetti for 
higher-quality carbs!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.810
Anyways, let's eat 'til 
we're covered in chocolate!

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:33.180
We're finished.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.400
Yeah... I'm out of ideas.

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:39.390
I give up, too.

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:42.370
Hey, why don't you ask Shikamaru?

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.430
Shikamaru?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:45.620
Right!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.390
Shikamaru's IQ is over 200,

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:49.340
he might know what to do!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.580
You guys are so dumb.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.220
She turned down chocolate,

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.090
she just sighed at fireworks,

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.850
and you still don't know?

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.690
There's only one thing that'll put
a woman in that kind of funk.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:05.480
What is it?

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.770
Love, my friend. Love.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.810
L-L-L-Love?!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.770
Tenten's in—

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.260
He's right, that depressed 
attitude is just...

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.370
...what you'd expect of
someone worried about love!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.260
Any clues?

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:22.740
Maybe she reunited with 
someone recently?

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.290
I think I know...

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.940
So that's it...

00:18:27.940 --> 00:18:29.240
Tenten's...

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.960
Neji, follow me!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.500
We have to help her!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.130
What're you talking about, Lee?

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.550
Hey!

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:42.230
Why so serious?

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:50.560
Lady Tsunade...

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:51.900
What's wrong?

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.510
You look troubled.

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:56.330
Yeah, a little...

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:00.430
Tell me all about it.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:02.670
You'll feel better if you 
get it off your chest.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:08.910
Lady Tsunade... I...

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.630
Huh?

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.370
He called you the president 
of punchlines?

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:16.500
Yes.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:18.590
During the fireworks show...

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.370
<i>Oh...</i>

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:22.850
<i>The president of punchlines?</i>

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.740
<i>President...</i>

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:27.380
<i>It's not like I enjoy it.</i>

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:30.060
<i>I don't know what I'm doing with my life!</i>

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:33.020
Ever since...

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:35.250
Hey, it's the punchline girl!

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:35.870
Let us have it!

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.480
Where's your paper fan?

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.070
Maybe I do only do punchlines,

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:43.870
but everyone's constantly setting me up.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:46.990
It's not like I'm really that into it.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:52.000
And now I'm worried about what 
I've been doing with my life.

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.170
Don't sweat it, 
you're fine the way you are.

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:03.010
Also, Lee and Neji are 
worried sick about you.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.530
Lee and Neji...

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.160
Your reactions are what 
make everyone so lively.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.830
Understand?

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:17.540
Yes! Thank you so much!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:20.870
Speak of the devils.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.990
Lee, Neji...

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:28.420
I'm sorry you guys were 
worried about me.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.570
No, we should be apologizing.

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:35.960
We finally realized you've 
been worried about romance.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:42.680
In hindsight, the signs you 
were sending were obvious.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:44.890
What...? What?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:49.020
Given who he is, I don't 
blame you for being upset.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.850
It's a forbidden of love, after all.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:55.310
But we steeled ourselves 
and went to see him!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:59.020
Whoa, whoa, went to see who?

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:01.990
Orochimaru, who else?

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:04.180
<i>Tenten's in love with you!</i>

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.190
<i>Please, at least meet with her!</i>

00:21:07.950 --> 00:21:10.910
<i>You've gotta be kidding me! Forget it!</i>

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:16.390
There are plenty of fish in the sea.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.770
Yeah, so cheer up, okay, Tenten?

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:28.660
Are your brains broken?!

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.990
How stupid are you two?!

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:33.520
How can you say that?!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:37.010
Here, listen to your own hearts!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:43.490
Tenten, there really is
no show without you.

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:24.660
Tenten, I'm so glad you're 
not upset anymore!

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:28.780
Now, next week is "Summer 
means Seashell Styles!"

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:31.100
<b>Summer means Seashell Styles!
Watermelon Wars!</b>

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:31.090
and "Watermelon Wars!"

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:32.950
What does "Seashell Styles" even mean?

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.100
Even for a summer theme 
it makes no sense.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:37.020
Yeah, that's a weird one, huh?

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:40.890
No girls in this anime 
have watermelons, either—

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:41.710
Shut up!

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:43.700
That's not what the title means!

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:48.550
Oh, Tenten, your punchlines 
are even more intense now...
